# Harness Quality Bar

- Follow grading criteria in `agents/criteria/*.md` and evaluator guidance in `agents/evaluator.md`.
- Evaluate against sprint contract acceptance criteria, not high-level impressions.
- Treat partial implementation as failure for the affected criterion.
- Include reproducible failure steps and concrete evidence in QA reports.
- Preserve design language from `docs/spec.md`; generic defaults are not acceptable.
- If confidence is low, call out risks explicitly instead of overstating quality.
